# BSS MVP API smoke requests
# Compatible with VS Code REST Client and JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Replace placeholders locally. Never commit real credentials.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@email = admin@example.test
@password = LOCAL_ONLY_PLACEHOLDER
@today = 2026-07-25

### Login — client stores returned cookies
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Verified session context
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### Refresh and rotate session cookies
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Dashboard smoke
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard-summary?date={{today}}

### Organization — expected 200 for admin, 403 for insufficient role
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization

### Departments in effective scope
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments

### Idempotent logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
